        <mxCell id="prodtxt" value="&lt;b&gt;Region ap-southeast-2 (us-east-1: TF state, GuardKite)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;3 public /24 (10.30.1–3.0) + 3 private /24 (10.30.4–6.0)&lt;br&gt;AZs 2a/2b/2c · IGW · 3 NAT instances (t3.nano)&lt;br&gt;VGW vgw-022094ced683ab16e → VPN → Nocelle&lt;br&gt;  192.168.0.0/24 (static route)&lt;br&gt;No VPC endpoints · no flow logs · no peering&lt;br&gt;Default VPC 172.31.0.0/16 unused&lt;br&gt;  (vpc-057d805d64b10952d)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Workload: ECS Fargate (cluster divi-prod), 7 Lambdas,&lt;br&gt;RDS PostgreSQL, MSK + MSK Connect, ALB, Amplify" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#232F3E;strokeColor=#C5CCD3;fillColor=#FFFFFF;rounded=1;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="prodacct">
